msgid "{buyer_name} 님이 {region_name:에서}({region_id}) {amount}({currency}) 으로 등록된 아이템({item_names})을 구매, 판매자: {seller_name}"
msgstr "{buyer_name} ได้ซื้อ ({item_names}) ใน {region_name} ({region_id}) ในราคา {amount} ({currency}) ผู้ขาย: {seller_name}"

